<section class="section" id="engineering">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="reveal"><p class="section-label">/ 工程</p><h2 class="section-title">AI × 量化 × 多智能体<br><span class="gold">把复杂变成优雅</span></h2></div>
    <div class="projects-grid">
      <div class="project-card reveal delay-1"><div class="project-icon">📊</div><div class="project-name">全自动量化交易系统</div><div class="project-desc">缠论二买二卖 + 四级结构，V7 → V7PRO → V9 迭代，引入移动止损、多级别联立、等比止盈，<span class="gold-text">实盘运行中</span></div></div>
      <div class="project-card reveal delay-2"><div class="project-icon">🧠</div><div class="project-name">多智能体协作架构</div><div class="project-desc">安月总线 — 多 AI Agent 通信编排系统，管理 <span class="gold-text">疏月·知禾·夏嫣</span> 三 Agent 分工协作</div></div>
      <div class="project-card reveal delay-3"><div class="project-icon">🔗</div><div class="project-name">双平台 Agent 生态</div><div class="project-desc">Hermes Agent + OpenClaw 双平台 · 微信直连 Claude Code（cc-connect）· 长期记忆系统（PLUR）</div></div>
      <div class="project-card reveal delay-4"><div class="project-icon">⚡</div><div class="project-name">Deep-Think 架构</div><div class="project-desc">自研混合工作流 — Pro 深度分析 + Flash 快速执行，跨模型协同，<span class="gold-text">降本增效</span></div></div>
    </div>
